   "floor-to-ceiling glass on the LEFT with bright daylight, potted palms. Use as the exact location reference; the "
   "lobby in it is empty and its contents are not copied."),
 "building_exterior": ("the bright paved forecourt in front of 景宸大厦 — frosted-glass entrance doors behind, a "
   "kerb, and a row of black executive sedans parked nose to tail along it, street trees and a security barrier. Use "
   "as the exact location reference."),
 "car_interior": ("the rear cabin of a black executive sedan at night, seen from the front seats looking back — a "
   "wide pale-grey leather rear bench, a central armrest, chrome door handles, warm amber courtesy lights along the "
   "roof lining, tinted windows with city bokeh sliding past. Use as the exact location and lighting reference; the "
   "car in it is empty."),
 "alley_gate": ("the end of a narrow old brick alley at night — a tall vermilion-red lacquered double gate with "
   "brass studs, stone drums on either side, a warm paper lantern above the lintel and a shaft of warm light through "
   "the half-open gap, moss between the paving stones. Use as the exact location and lighting reference."),

 # ---- 第 2 集起的新场景（2026-10-03 新增，全部已提亮到「明确偏亮」）----
