   "green glass-shaded desk lamp, a brass pen tray, a white porcelain teacup and several photographs laid face-up, a "
   "high-backed dark leather armchair behind it, a curtained window on the side wall, wood panelling and a dark rug. "
   "The desk lamp and a floor lamp are both switched on and generous, so the room reads warm and clearly lit with "
   "open, detailed shadows and no black areas. Use as the exact location and lighting reference; the room in it is "
   "empty and the photographs in it are unreadable blanks."),
 "hospital_pay": ("the in-patient payment counter of a Chinese city hospital in daylight — a row of pale wood-finished "
   "service windows with half-height glass screens and round speaking holes, a pale quartz counter top carrying card "
   "readers, a stamp pad and the back of a monitor, a pale-grey clerical area behind, a full run of white ceiling "
   "fluorescent tubes switched on, pale-grey polished tile floor and off-white walls. Use as the exact location and "
   "lighting reference; the counter in it is empty."),
 "locker": ("the staff changing room of an office tower in daylight — two rows of pale-grey metal staff lockers "
   "facing each other across a narrow aisle, locker doors with keyholes and blank nameplates, a curtained changing "
   "bay at the far end of the aisle, two white fluorescent tubes switched on above the aisle, pale anti-slip tile "
   "floor and a wooden bench along one wall carrying a blue plastic bucket and a mop. Use as the exact location and "
   "lighting reference; the room in it is empty."),

 # ---- 第 3 集起的新场景 ----
 "lu_gate": ("the gate house front of the old 陆 family mansion in bright mid-morning — a grey-brick and grey-tile "
