   "carrying a white porcelain teapot, two cups and a lit brass table lamp, an old round wall clock, and the inner "
   "door standing open onto a flagstone courtyard full of light. The ceiling light is switched on and generous, and "
   "the doorway pours daylight in, so the little room reads bright with open, detailed shadows. Use as the exact "
   "location and lighting reference; the room in it is empty."),
 "lu_veranda": ("the open covered veranda of the old 陆 family mansion in the afternoon — a row of dark red timber "
   "posts receding along a depth axis under a grey-tile roof, a flagstone courtyard and the opposite wing outside "
   "the posts, a grey-brick inner wall hung with a run of framed old photographs in a row that recedes with the "
   "veranda, a dark timber floor and a side door at the far end. Low afternoon sun rakes in from the right and lays "
