   "floor. The round flush ceiling light is switched on and generously lit and the table lamp is switched on too, so "
   "the little room reads warm and clearly lit with open, detailed shadows and no black areas. Use as the exact "
   "location and lighting reference; the room in it is empty apart from the bed, the cabinet, the table and the lamp."),
 "hospital_station": ("the inpatient-department nurses' station of the city No.1 hospital on an early bright morning — "
   "a long pale counter running across the MID-ground of the depth axis, with an old desktop computer, several "
   "stacks of case files, a pen and a thick bed-allocation ledger on it; behind the counter a wall of labelled "
   "pigeon-hole medicine cabinets; bright ceiling lights on, and clean morning window light raking in from the "
   "side and behind; pale-grey tile floor. Everything is clean, bright and open, with no dark corners. Use as the "
   "exact location and lighting reference; the station in it is empty of people."),
 "lu_storage": ("a cluttered old storage room in the rear courtyard of the 陆 family old house at night — two rows of "
   "iron shelving reaching up to the ceiling on either side of one deep centre aisle, loaded with old trunks, "
   "rolled-up carpets, dusty porcelain and old tools; a single fluorescent tube on the ceiling is switched on and "
   "lights the shelves and the concrete floor clearly; the open doorway at the near end shows the lit courtyard "
   "outside, so the night reads lit rather than black; bare concrete floor, swept, with dust only in the corners. "
   "Use as the exact location and lighting reference; the room in it is empty."),
 "rental_gate": ("the street doorway of an old low-rise residential block at night — two or three worn concrete "
   "steps up to a half-open metal gate with the stairwell light glowing through the gap, a single old street lamp "
   "directly overhead switched on and throwing a warm yellow pool over the doorstep, a bicycle leaning against the "
   "wall beside the gate, a few old flyers pasted on the plastered wall, worn bare ground. It is night but "
   "generously lit — street lamp, stairwell light and the lamps along the street are all on. Use as the exact "
   "location and lighting reference; the doorway in it is empty of people."),
}

